            "currentOtherStorage": "negotiation.status withdrawn/deadline; explicit decline and automatic lapse converge",
            "immutableReconstruction": "Old historical tick/deadline might constrain causes but no immutable command link contract is verified. Capture at answerCounter(false) / lapseCounters instead.",
            "provenance": "emission_snapshot",
            "captureRule": "Record explicit decline only when non-noop answerCounter(false) settles the matching counter. Record expired only the deadline path. Never classify missing data as expired."
