            "currentOtherStorage": "MarriagePlan negotiationId/groomId/brideId; current groom role may change and off-map groom ID materialises at contract",
            "immutableReconstruction": "Conditional future adapter only: later record must carry an immutable contract record reference; exact unique retained contracted record and identities must agree. Existing later bride/brotherInLaw or estate/rival alone do not prove a unique join. No nearest-record join.",
